### 1. Create an address book
POST http://localhost:8080/addressBooks
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2a. Create buddy 1
POST http://localhost:8080/buddies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "phoneNumber": "613-555-1234",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "address": "123 Main St"
}

### 2b. Create buddy 2
POST http://localhost:8080/buddies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mohamed Cherif",
  "phoneNumber": "613-333-2233",
  "email": "mbah@example.com",
  "address": "122 Great-Lakes St"
}

### 3a. Add buddy 1 to address book 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/buddies/1/addressBook
Content-Type: text/uri-list

http://localhost:8080/addressBooks/1

### 3b. Add buddy 2 to address book 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/buddies/2/addressBook
Content-Type: text/uri-list

http://localhost:8080/addressBooks/1

### 4. Verify
GET http://localhost:8080/addressBooks/1/buddies